WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.666 --> 00:00:04.791
You think the playoffs are a gift you get every year?

00:00:06.416 --> 00:00:09.416
You think the gods of this game have a soft spot

00:00:09.791 --> 00:00:11.083
for those pretty

00:00:11.791 --> 00:00:13.708
hazel eyes?

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:20.958
It’s here and it’s gone, boy

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:25.000
One minute, you’re in the dance

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
But the next, you’re on the Timberwolves

00:00:29.541 --> 00:00:32.625
And you’re stuck praying for pingpong balls

00:00:33.708 --> 00:00:35.000
For the rest

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.041
of your

00:00:36.041 --> 00:00:37.166
forgotten

00:00:37.166 --> 00:00:38.375
career

